
---
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/home.css';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <title>Methodology | SLAM Research</title>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="/slam/">SLAM Research</a>
      <a class="nav-button" href="/slam/">Home</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container section">
    <span class="section-label">METHODOLOGY</span>
    <h1 class="section-title">The geometric pipeline</h1>

    <p class="muted">
      This section describes the algorithms implemented in the project.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Feature extraction and matching</h2>
    <p>
      Identify visual features in consecutive images and establish
      correspondences between observations.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Perspective-n-Point</h2>
    <p>
      Estimate camera pose from 2D-3D correspondences. RANSAC
      is used to handle outliers in the correspondence set.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Iterative Closest Point</h2>
    <p>
      Estimate relative motion through point-cloud alignment.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Trajectory accumulation</h2>
    <p>
      Compose relative transformations to obtain the camera trajectory.
      The transform direction and inversion convention must be
      specified consistently.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
